00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.000
cover yourself in mercury--maybe not the best idea.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.400
I don't know

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.000
interesting metal...

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.000
interesting...

